      ":question/problem": "Which of the following elementary row operations transforms the matrix $X$ into the matrix $W$, where\n\n$$\nX=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\nW=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 3 & 9 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$",
